Project Demonstration

Project Name

Auto Ticket Classification System

Purpose of the Project

The purpose of this project is to automatically classify support tickets into appropriate categories based on their descriptions.

Benefits of the Project

The system reduces manual classification work, saves time, organizes support tickets, and helps support teams handle tickets efficiently.

Working Process

First, the user enters or submits a support ticket. The system receives the ticket description and processes the text. The classification model analyzes the ticket and predicts the appropriate category. Finally, the predicted category is displayed on the screen.

Final Output

The system successfully classifies the submitted support ticket and displays the predicted category.

Demo Video

The project demonstration video will show the complete working process, including ticket submission, classification, and final output.

